{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/542352-taking-out-the-trash","id":542352,"title":"Taking out the Trash","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-06T00:42:38-07:00","id":542352,"title":"Taking out the Trash","content":"Hello brothers and sisters, fellow demons of the day and night. Denizens of information, and destruction alike.<br /> <br /> We have a breach in security, two new demons that have recently fell are to not be trusted within your respected territories. These two know nothing of the laws that help us stay silent to the Old Lord, in fact they refuse to listen to more experienced demons that have given them tips of keeping their tracks hidden. This normally isn't so bad, but lets say one of them was caught on camera, helping a newly fallen brother within the Bronx district of New York City... while wearing her uniform from work. I have tracked them to an apartment within the Bronx area, and am currently hiding out... waiting... biding my time... if they pose a threat then I will enact &quot;Project: Grocery List.&quot; This project basically means I will kill, dismember, and either eat or sell their parts on the demonic black market.<br /> <br /> 1) Poses as a coffee clerk in a local coffee house... not Star Schmucks. Her cover is that of an Asian young woman, rather young but regularly gets yelled at by her boss for not doing her job correctly. From the way she carries herself, and everything my Demonic Eye can see, she is a hand to hand specialist. Fists. No calluses which show use of any form of weaponry, so she shouldn't be too much trouble to take out if she comes within your territories. From preliminary... stalking... she was a guardian of the lowest order, with some interesting parts to her, I have yet to ascertain her Agenda, if she has one. Wait one sec.... *places hand on ear piece and listens in for a few second* Scratch that, she is a Saboteur it would seem... strange, it didn't seem like she had any contacts that could help out with that cause...<br /> <br /> 2) Young man, recently fallen, looks to be mid 20s perhaps early 30s. His intelligence seems rather low, perhaps a defective model, as he only repeats the phrasing &quot;I like Eggs.&quot;... Huh. Moving on, this one seems remarkably harmless, no weapon skills to speak from if the preliminary observations are to be believed... must be an Analyst... or maybe a Psychopomp. *listens in on his earpiece once more before the pencil is crushed in his hand* So... this one just got on my shit list... from information he just gave to the previous target, he was a Destroyer before he fell. Also states he has never destroyed anything, no combat ability whatsoever. Definitely a defective model... shall be eliminated as soon as I am able to get him alone.<br /> <br /> Since the new demon will not be surviving the week, do not watch for him. The other on the other hand, if she is to enter your territory, please keep an eye on her or out right eliminate her. As stated before, she refuses to accept help from other demons, and has given her identity to the Old Lord by being seen on camera at the sight of a Fall, in her main cover and in clothing that pinpoints her location.<br /> <br /> Stay safe brothers and sisters. Demon Lord Chaos, signing off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4565,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","user":"ZeriqHaruk","date":". 06-06-2015, 03:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","name":"ZeriqHaruk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":